++- harvest to: `unity/Assets/Docs/Architecture/13-resource-system.md`、`18-asset-description.md`、必要なら起動文書
++- Phase A snapshot path / id: `artifacts/bs3-phase-a/phase-a-r2.md`（旧 `phase-a.md` は revision 1 記録）
